cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research software, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "JEVPFN: Decision-model text features for tabular prediction"
authors:
  - family-names: Goethals
    given-names: Andreas
    affiliation: KU Leuven
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: https://github.com/andreasgoethals/JEVPFN
url: https://github.com/andreasgoethals/JEVPFN
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Research software for comparing deterministic, label-free probabilistic text
  features from decision models on 18 selected MulTaBench text datasets.
  Exploration retains all 20 core datasets. Cached per-column and joint text
  representations support controlled comparisons with tabular predictors.
keywords:
  - tabular prediction
  - decision models
  - text features
  - MulTaBench
